## Asset Provenance

All assets in Flatlands, such, as buildings, trains, railway tracks, nature foliage, street furniture and autonomous entities are built at run time using Three.js `BufferGeometry` primitives (`class B` procedural mesh builder). No third‑party proprietary 3D mesh files (.gltf,.fbx.obj) or external bitmap textures were used. Procedural sound effects are created on the fly with the Web Audio API (`AudioContext` oscillator and noise envelopes). I hope you find this overview helpful.
